  "streets": {
   "Ketevan Dedoplis Avenue": "Kakheti road (on the 1735 plan), Kakheti street (1867 plan), Great Kakheti street (1895 plan), Stepane Shaumyan 1923, Ketevan the Martyr 1990, current name 2005 (the article title has no 'Tsminda')",
