   "Tevdore Mghvdeli Street": "Andria street until 1922 (also on the 1876 plan), Sergo Ordzhonikidze after 1922 (no year), Karl Marx 1930; the current name was given to one section in 1990",
   "Nikoloz Khudadov Street": "Remontnaya street (1903 list), Khudadov for a time (no years), Remontnaya again in the 1920s, Khudadov restored in the 1950s",
   "Giorgi Tsabadze Street": "Mikheil lane, Mushtaidi lane (1876 plan), Ernst Thalmann 1934, Tsabadze 1990",
   "Atsquri Street": "Ferma-Avlabari great prospect until the 1920s, Atsquri great prospect (1926 reference book), Atsquri street (1940 reference book)",
   "Giorgi Chitaia Street": "Avchala street (1851 plan), Vasil Cherkezishvili 1910, Soviet street 1922, Karl Marx 1930, Soviet street 1938, Chitaia 1992",
   "Beri Gabriel Salosi Avenue": "Slaughterhouse street, Karaia great road (1934 plan), Bogdan Khmelnitsky 1954, other section names (Soldiers, Reuter, Germans 1922, 5 December 1939, Kakutsa Cholokashvili 1991), Salosi 2014; the order of the section names is not clear, not used on the site",
   "Revaz Tabukashvili Street": "Sappers street (1841 list), Boris Dzneladze in the 1930s (1934 plan), Ioane Petritsi 1990, Tabukashvili 1992",
   "Navtlughi Street": "Weissenhof street (1876 and 1895 plans), Navtlughi (1903 list)",
   "Heydar Aliyev Right Bank Embankment": "only 2007 (named after Aliyev); 'Right bank' as a former name is NOT stated",
   "Noe Zhordania Embankment": "no page found"
  }
